  "description": "VUCWIC crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H168 Ho9 N16 O42 1-,H3 O1 1+,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 10 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho7 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho8 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho9 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.598-5.103 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.79-173.45°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H175Ho9N16O45. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
